        "id": "firing-deck"
      }
    ],
    "summary": "No. A weapon a TRANSPORT borrows through Firing Deck loses any benefit that applied only while its embarked unit held it. So when a Trukk uses Snazzguns from embarked Flash Gitz led by a Big Mek carrying Targetin' Squigs, it gains neither Finderz Keeperz, which belongs to the Flash Gitz, nor More Dakka, which belongs to that Big Mek, and the Targetin' Squigs enhancement does not help either.",
